## Summary of Pages Router APIs in Use

| API | Location | Usage |
|-----|----------|-------|
| `getServerSideProps()` | `/pages/index.js` | Server-side rendering on every request |
| `getStaticProps()` | `/pages/blog/index.js`, `/pages/blog/[id].js` | Static generation with ISR |
| `getStaticPaths()` | `/pages/blog/[id].js` | Pre-generate dynamic routes at build |
| `getInitialProps()` | `/pages/_error.js` | Legacy server-side data for errors |
| `useRouter()` | Multiple pages | Client-side navigation & query access |
| `router.isFallback` | `/pages/blog/[id].js` | Check if page is being generated |
| `router.back()` | `/pages/blog/[id].js` | Navigate back in history |
| `next/head` | Multiple pages | Dynamic head management |
| Dynamic Routes | `/pages/blog/[id].js`, `/pages/api/posts/[id].js` | `[id]` parameter pattern |
| API Routes | `/pages/api/posts/` | Built-in API handling |
| Custom `_app.js` | `/pages/_app.js` | Global layout wrapper |
| Custom `_document.js` | `/pages/_document.js` | Root HTML document customization |
| Custom `_error.js` | `/pages/_error.js` | Global error handling |
| Custom `404.js` | `/pages/404.js` | Custom not found page |

---

## Migration Complexity Assessment

**High Complexity Areas:**
1. **Dynamic routes** - `[id]` patterns need conversion to `[id]/page.tsx`
2. **ISR (Incremental Static Regeneration)** - `revalidate` needs conversion to `revalidate` in layout/page config
3. **getStaticPaths/getStaticProps** - Need to move logic to dynamic route params and generateStaticParams
4. **getServerSideProps** - Convert to Server Components or route handlers
5. **_app.js layout** - Needs to become root layout with proper provider setup
6. **_document.js** - Move to layout.tsx for metadata/head setup
7. **API Routes** - Move to `app/api/` directory with route handlers
8. **Error handling** - Custom error.tsx and not-found.tsx pages
9. **useRouter** - Some functionality moves to useRouter from next/navigation

This is a comprehensive Pages Router application with all major routing patterns represented. Ready for App Router migration planning.

